usage: compcert-verify.py [-h] {gate} ...

Final evidence acceptance for CompCert correspondence and CBMC reproof. This
checks existing evidence; it does not generate models or write proofs.
Additional functional, safety and termination goals require their own
evidence.

positional arguments:
  {gate}
    gate      Check existing execution and CBMC-reproof evidence

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
